Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|false|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Reports|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Definition No Template
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Report Admin|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Definitions
	And LexiconEntry goto Add
	And PortletEntry input Name
		|name|Reports Definition Name|
	And Button click Save
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'Please enter a valid file.' at locator 'Message#ERROR'
Scenario: Download Report PG
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Report Admin|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Definitions
	And ReportsAdmin add Report Definition
		|dataSource|Portal|
		|reportsDefinitionDescription|Reports Definition Description|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
		|templateFile|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.jrxml|
	And ReportsAdmin add Report Entry
		|emailNotificationsAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|emailRecipientAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|reportFormat|pdf|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Reports Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Report Display|
	And ReportsDisplayPortlet view Report Entry
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
	Then ReportsDisplayPortlet download Report Entry File
		|reportFormat|pdf|
		|reportsFileName|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.pdf|
Scenario: View Definitions Pagination
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Report Admin|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Definitions
	And ReportsAdmin add Report Definition
		|dataSource|Portal|
		|reportsDefinitionDescription|Reports Definition Description|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition 1|
		|templateFile|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.jrxml|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Definitions
	And ReportsAdmin add Report Definition
		|dataSource|Portal|
		|reportsDefinitionDescription|Reports Definition Description|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition 2|
		|templateFile|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.jrxml|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Definitions
	And ReportsAdmin add Report Definition
		|dataSource|Portal|
		|reportsDefinitionDescription|Reports Definition Description|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition 3|
		|templateFile|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.jrxml|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Definitions
	And ReportsAdmin add Report Definition
		|dataSource|Portal|
		|reportsDefinitionDescription|Reports Definition Description|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition 4|
		|templateFile|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.jrxml|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Definitions
	And ReportsAdmin add Report Definition
		|dataSource|Portal|
		|reportsDefinitionDescription|Reports Definition Description|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition 5|
		|templateFile|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.jrxml|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Definitions
	And ReportsAdmin add Report Definition
		|dataSource|Portal|
		|reportsDefinitionDescription|Reports Definition Description|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition 6|
		|templateFile|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.jrxml|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Definitions
	And Pagination change Pagination
		|itemsPerPage|5|
	And these variables
		|key_reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition 6|
	And AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'ReportsAdmin#DEFINITIONS_DEFINITION_TABLE_DEFINITION_NAME'
	And Click at locator 'Pagination#NEXT_LINK'
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Reports Definition 6' at locator 'ReportsAdmin#DEFINITIONS_DEFINITION_TABLE_DEFINITION_NAME'
	And Click at locator 'Pagination#PREVIOUS_LINK'
	Then AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'ReportsAdmin#DEFINITIONS_DEFINITION_TABLE_DEFINITION_NAME'
Scenario: View Report Email New Configuration
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|ReportsUsecase#ViewReportEmailNewConfiguration|
	And these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And these properties
		|test.smtp.server.enabled|true|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Report Admin|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Configuration
	And ReportsAdmin configure Email From
		|emailFromAddress|user1@liferay.com|
		|emailFromName|Liferay QA|
	And IFrame close Frame
	And ReportsAdmin goto Configuration
	And ReportsAdmin configure Delivery Email
		|deliverySubject||
		|deliveryBody||
	And IFrame close Frame
	And ReportsAdmin goto Configuration
	And ReportsAdmin configure Notifications Email
		|notificationSubject||
		|notificationBody||
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Report Admin|
	And ReportsAdmin goto Definitions
	And ReportsAdmin add Report Definition
		|dataSource|Portal|
		|reportsDefinitionDescription|Reports Definition Description|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
		|templateFile|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.jrxml|
	And ReportsAdmin add Report Entry
		|emailNotificationsAddress|user2@liferay.com|
		|emailRecipientAddress|user3@liferay.com|
		|reportFormat|pdf|
		|reportsDefinitionName|Reports Definition Name|
	And MockMock view Mail
		|asset|New Report From QA: reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.pdf|
		|content|You have a new|
		|recipient|user2@liferay.com|
		|sender|Liferay QA|
		|subject|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.pdf|
	And MockMock view Mail
		|asset|New Report From QA: reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.pdf|
		|content|Please review the attached report from your friends in QA!|
		|recipient|user3@liferay.com|
		|sender|Liferay QA|
		|subject|reports_admin_template_source_sample_class_name.pdf|
	And Open at locator '${portalURL}'
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Report Admin|
	Then ReportsAdmin tear Down Configuration
